er-init","content":"Next steps after init"},"2005":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-19","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#overview","content":"`fastskill project init` creates a single file: `skill-project.toml` in the current directory. If a `SKILL.md` is present, it extracts metadata (version, description, author) from its frontmatter; anything missing is either taken from CLI flags or prompted for interactively."},"2006":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-20","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#overview","content":"`project init` writes **only** `skill-project.toml`. It does not create a skills directory, example skills, or any other file. All FastSkill configuration lives in `skill-project.toml`."},"2007":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-21","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#overview","content":"**Context detection**: `project init` detects whether you're in a skill directory or a project root:"},"2008":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-22","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#overview","content":"**Skill-level**: run in a directory containing `SKILL.md` — writes a `[metadata]` section for skill authors. `skills_directory` is optional."},"2009":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-23","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#overview","content":"**Project-level**: run at a project root — writes `[dependencies]` for skill consumers. A skills directory is required (via `--skills-dir`, or the prompt)."},"2010":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-24","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#what-it-does","content":"**Checks for an existing file**: refuses to overwrite `skill-project.toml` unless `--force` is given."},"2011":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-25","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#what-it-does","content":"**Reads `SKILL.md`** (if present): pulls `version`, `description`, and `author` from the frontmatter."},"2012":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-26","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#what-it-does","content":"**Resolves missing fields**: from CLI flags, or by prompting (unless `--yes`)."},"2013":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-27","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#what-it-does","content":"**Writes `skill-project.toml`**: with `[metadata]`, `[dependencies]`, and — when a skills directory is set — `[tool.fastskill]`."},"2014":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-28","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#what-it-does","content":"**Validates**: the skill ID (derived from the directory name) and the version (must be valid semver)."},"2015":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-29","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#interactive-setup","content":"Prompts for each missing field. For example, at a project root:"},"2016":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-30","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#non-interactive-setup","content":"At a project root, `--yes` requires `--skills-dir <path>`. Without it, either drop `--yes` to be prompted or pass the flag."},"2017":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-31","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Option"},"2018":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-32","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Description"},"2019":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-33","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Default"},"2020":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-34","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`--yes`"},"2021":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-35","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Skip interactive prompts and use defaults"},"2022":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-36","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`false`"},"2023":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-37","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`--force`"},"2024":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-38","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Overwrite an existing `skill-project.toml`"},"2025":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-39","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`false`"},"2026":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-40","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`--set-version <VER>`"},"2027":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-41","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Set the skill version (validated as semver)"},"2028":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-42","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"from `SKILL.md`, else `1.0.0`"},"2029":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-43","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`--description <TEXT>`"},"2030":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-44","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Set the description"},"2031":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-45","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"from `SKILL.md`, else empty"},"2032":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-46","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`--author <NAME>`"},"2033":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-47","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Set the author"},"2034":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-48","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"from `SKILL.md`, else empty"},"2035":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-49","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`--download-url <URL>`"},"2036":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-50","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Set the download URL"},"2037":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-51","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"empty"},"2038":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-52","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`--skills-dir <DIR>`"},"2039":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-53","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"Skills directory (global flag)"},"2040":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-54","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#command-options","content":"`.claude/skills`"},"2041":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-55","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#the-file-it-creates","content":"At a project root, `project init` produces a `skill-project.toml` like:"},"2042":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-56","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#the-file-it-creates","content":"The commented block is written verbatim so you can uncomment and fill in embedding settings or repositories later."},"2043":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-57","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#skills-directory","content":"**Default**: `.claude/skills`"},"2044":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-58","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#skills-directory","content":"**Custom**: any path you pass via `--skills-dir` or the prompt"},"2045":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-59","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#skills-directory","content":"**Resolution at runtime**: `--skills-dir` flag > `--global` (`~/.config/fastskill/skills`) > `skills_directory` under `[tool.fastskill]` > walk up to an existing `.claude/skills/` > default `.claude/skills/`"},"2046":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-60","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#schema-version","content":"`project init` writes the current manifest schema. Use the generated file as the\nstarting point and keep project configuration in version control."},"2047":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-61","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#embedding-configuration","content":"Semantic search uses OpenAI-compatible embeddings, configured under `[tool.fastskill.embedding]` in `skill-project.toml` (not created by `project init` — add it when you need it):"},"2048":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-62","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#embedding-configuration","content":"Set the API key via the environment; if it is unset, semantic search is silently skipped:"},"2049":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-63","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"`skill-project.toml` is committed and shared by everyone on the project, so it is\nthe wrong place to record that *your* machine — or one CI job — talks to a\ndifferent embedding endpoint. Both non-secret fields can be overridden from the\nenvironment, and the environment wins:"},"2050":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-64","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"Variable"},"2051":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-65","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"Overrides"},"2052":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-66","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"Example"},"2053":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-67","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"`OPENAI_BASE_URL`"},"2054":{"id":"/configuratio