ngth. After switching\nmodels, run `fastskill index rebuild` before searching, or results will be meaningless."},"2062":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-76","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"The API key stays environment-only on purpose: a committed manifest is the wrong\nhome for a secret."},"2063":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-77","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#skill-projecttoml-already-exists-use---force-to-overwrite","content":"**Cause**: a `skill-project.toml` is already present.\n**Solution**: pass `--force` to overwrite it, or remove the file first."},"2064":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-78","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#project-level-init-requires---skills-dir","content":"**Cause**: `--yes` was used at a project root without a skills directory.\n**Solution**: add `--skills-dir <path>`, or drop `--yes` to be prompted."},"2065":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-79","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#invalid-version","content":"**Cause**: the version (from `--set-version` or `SKILL.md`) is not valid semver.\n**Solution**: use a semver string such as `1.0.0`."},"2066":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-80","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#permission-denied","content":"**Cause**: the current directory is not writable.\n**Solution**: fix permissions or run in a directory where you have write access."},"2067":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-81","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#next-steps-after-init","content":"**Add skills**: `fastskill skill add <skill-id>` (registry, Git, or local path)."},"2068":{"id":"/configur