ectory name (`steps/step_0000`). Pass the number you read\noff `status`; there is no off-by-one to translate."},"2718":{"id":"/optimize/results-16","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#inspect-a-step","content":"With no `--show`, `inspect` prints every artifact for that step (`--show all`)."},"2719":{"id":"/optimize/results-17","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Value"},"2720":{"id":"/optimize/results-18","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Output"},"2721":{"id":"/optimize/results-19","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`all` (default)"},"2722":{"id":"/optimize/results-20","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Patch, skill diff, gate decision, skip info, and per-case rollouts"},"2723":{"id":"/optimize/results-21","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`patches`"},"2724":{"id":"/optimize/results-22","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"The raw JSON patch the optimizer proposed (`patch.json`)"},"2725":{"id":"/optimize/results-23","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`diffs`"},"2726":{"id":"/optimize/results-24","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Unified diff between consecutive skill versions — see Diffs"},"2727":{"id":"/optimize/results-25","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`gate`"},"2728":{"id":"/optimize/results-26","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"The accept/reject decision and scores (`gate.json`)"},"2729":{"id":"/optimize/results-27","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"`skips`"},"2730":{"id":"/optimize/results-28","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#show-only-what-you-need","content":"Edit-budget info derived from `update.json` — see Skips"},"2731":{"id":"/optimize/results-29","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#patches","content":"`patch.json` is an array of edits the optimizer proposed for this step:"},"2732":{"id":"/optimize/results-30","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#interpreting-the-gate","content":"`gate.json` records the accept/reject decision for the step:"},"2733":{"id":"/optimize/results-31","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#interpreting-the-gate","content":"`score` is the candidate's score for this step; `best_score` is the best seen so far in the\nrun. A patch is accepted only if it improves on the incumbent by at least `gate_epsilon`\n(see the configuration reference). When a step is rejected the\nskill document is left unchanged and no new version is written."},"2734":{"id":"/optimize/results-32","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#skips","content":"There is **no `skips.json` artifact**. Skip information is derived from `update.json`,\nwhich records how the step's edit budget was spent:"},"2735":{"id":"/optimize/results-33","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#skips","content":"`budget` is the number of edits the step was allowed to apply, `chosen` the indices of the\npatches it actually applied, and `skipped_count` how many proposed patches were dropped for